{"id":"2303910615f024a0","group":"20","path":"20/20-prop-mred-transfer.md","title":"many-one 归约传递可判定性与可枚举性","display":"prop-mred-transfer — many-one 归约传递可判定性与可枚举性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-prop-mred-transfer","aliases":["20-prop-mred-transfer"],"display":"prop-mred-transfer — many-one 归约传递可判定性与可枚举性","chapter":"1","section":"1.6；2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 1.6.10；Exercise 2.1.17(i)","source_printed_pages":[15,27],"source_pdf_pages":[51,63],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-prop-mred-transfer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-prop-mred-transfer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-mred-transfer — many-one 归约传递可判定性与可枚举性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6；2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 1.6.10；Exercise 2.1.17(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>15</span><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>51</span><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_m B\">\\(A\\le_m B\\)</span> 由全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 见证。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mred\\text{-}transfer}\\vdash\n(B\\in\\mathcal R\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal R)\\land(B\\in\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mred\\text{-}transfer}\\vdash\n(B\\in\\mathcal R\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal R)\\land(B\\in\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 B 可判定，χ_A(x)=χ_B(f(x))。若 B 可枚举，给 x 计算 f(x)，等待它进入 B，恰在 x∈A 时成功。第二种程序只半判定 A，不对否定输入宣称停止。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 1.6.10；Exercise 2.1.17(i)；印刷页 15, 27；PDF 第 51, 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_m B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mred\\text{-}transfer}\\vdash\n(B\\in\\mathcal R\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal R)\\land(B\\in\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow A\\in\\mathcal E).","display":true}],"bytes":1279,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","60af447f5d59a8dc"]}